      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Applies to all expenses on schedule: EQT's employees provide operational and back office support for the Company pursuant to the COM Agreements. Labor and personnel costs presented herein are either charged to the Company ,based on EQT's payroll labor distribution process for employees in EQT's sub departments directly supporting the Company or as part of an indirect cost allocation process. EQT primarily allocates indirect costs (including a portion of labor and personnel costs) based on factors determined through the annual business plan process, including net plant, adjusted EBITDA, headcount (as determined based on the payroll fixed labor distribution) and, where applicable, miles of pipeline.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
